{"root":"sopan","ipa":"/so.pan/","core":"形容词，指言行举止有礼貌、谦逊、文雅、合乎礼节。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/so.pan/","zh":"礼貌的，文雅的","phrases":[{"t":"sopan santun","zh":"彬彬有礼"},{"t":"berperilaku sopan","zh":"举止文雅"},{"t":"sangat sopan","zh":"非常有礼貌"}],"examples":[{"t":"Dia anak yang sangat sopan kepada orang tua.","zh":"他是一个对长辈非常有礼貌的孩子。"},{"t":"Kita harus bersikap sopan saat berbicara dengan orang lain.","zh":"我们在与他人交谈时必须保持礼貌。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"sopan","ipa":"/so.pan/","zh":"礼貌的","phrase":{"t":"tata krama sopan","zh":"礼节礼貌"},"example":{"t":"Gunakan bahasa yang sopan.","zh":"请使用礼貌的语言。"}},{"w":"kesopanan","ipa":"/kə.so.pa.nan/","zh":"礼貌，礼节，谦逊","phrase":{"t":"menjaga kesopanan","zh":"保持礼貌"},"example":{"t":"Kesopanan adalah cerminan kepribadian seseorang.","zh":"礼貌是一个人个性的体现。"}},{"w":"menyopankan","ipa":"/mə.ɲo.paŋ.kan/","zh":"使变得礼貌，使文雅化","phrase":{"t":"menyopankan diri","zh":"使自己变得更有礼貌"},"example":{"t":"Dia berusaha menyopankan tutur katanya.","zh":"他努力使自己的言谈变得更文雅。"}}],"derSlugs":["sopan","kesopanan","menyopankan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:12:50.841Z","src":"base"}